"Celena North is a university in Apex with a hero program, combat program and arts department."
"Celena North High is its feeder prep school, teaching mostly in English, with a School for the Arts."
"Its high school and college hero courses are well connected."
"Freshmen attend services for alumni who die in the line of duty."
"At such services hero students serve as honor guard in military-style formal jackets."
"Arts students provide music and flowers in waistcoats and standing collars."
"Names of fallen alumni carve themselves into granite memorial stones in its garden."
"The high school has Schools for the Arts, for Sciences, and for Superhuman Studies and Talent Development."
"Cafeteria North, the largest university dining hall, is closed to the public."
"The Triplanets have not given it magical gifts in decades."
